# Default working branch

Kyth's default working branch is `testing`, not `main`.

- Open new Cloud Agents on `github.com/mrtrick37/kyth` at branch `testing`.
- Do all routine work on `testing`. Commit and push directly to `origin/testing`.
- `main` is the stable promotion target only. Do not start routine work from `main`.
- If this session is on `main` (or any other branch) and the user did not explicitly ask to work on that branch or to promote to stable, switch before making changes:

  `git fetch origin testing && git checkout testing`
